&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#bfbfbf;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#bfbfbf;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:22pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;賃金のデジタル払いサービス提供開始&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;『Airワーク 給与支払』導入企業対象のサービスで、従業員はCoin＋搭載のエアウォレットで給与の即払いを受けることが可能に&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
